{"id":"edb21277c44f3177","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-prop-gch.md","title":"GCH Consequences","display":"prop-gch — GCH Consequences","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-gch","aliases":["58-prop-gch"],"display":"prop-gch — GCH Consequences","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-gch]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-gch"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-gch</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-gch — GCH Consequences"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" href=\"?note=f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-gch\">../batch08/58-df-gch</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\alpha\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" href=\"?note=f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-gch\">../batch08/58-df-gch</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GCH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GCH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the proposition defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" href=\"?note=f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-gch\">../batch08/58-df-gch</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}gch} \\vdash \\mathrm{GCH}\\to\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\beth_\\alpha=\\aleph_\\alpha\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}gch} \\vdash \\mathrm{GCH}\\to\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\beth_\\alpha=\\aleph_\\alpha\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Under GCH, most cardinal arithmetic simplifies.</li>\n<li>GCH fixes the continuum function on infinite cardinals, but many set-theoretic statements remain independent even after GCH is assumed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-gch","status":"resolved","id":"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-gch]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-gch","status":"resolved","id":"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ is the predicate from [[../batch08/58-df-gch]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-gch","status":"resolved","id":"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GCH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the proposition defined in [[../batch08/58-df-gch]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GCH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}gch} \\vdash \\mathrm{GCH}\\to\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\beth_\\alpha=\\aleph_\\alpha\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":817,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3963","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-prop-gch.md|58-prop-gch]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["f13d4bbe06c4eb5a","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}